1 > 2 // The preview page: the app's own kit draws the one whole-page screen through
2 < 2 // one Renderer over a store filled from the bundle's stories. At / the approved
3 < 2 // spec (else ?v=<V>, else A); at /compare every whole-page version side by
4 < 2 // side, each with a "Choose <V>" button; the chosen version (clicked here, else
5 < 2 // the one whose spec equals the approved screen) reads "Chosen ✓" and is
6 < 2 // outlined. Specs arrive over /ws and redraw in place; when the versions change
7 < 2 // the pick clicked here is dropped. Plays run one at a time on the one shared store.
0 < 2 // The preview page: the app's own kit draws each piece's spec over a store
1 < 2 // filled from the bundle's stories. At / each piece's approved spec (else
2 < 2 // ?v=<V>, else A); at /compare every version side by side, each with a
3 < 2 // "Choose <V>" button; the chosen version (clicked here, else the one whose
4 < 2 // spec equals the approved screen) reads "Chosen ✓" and is outlined. Specs
6 > 2 // arrive over /ws and redraw in place; a piece whose versions change loses the
7 < 2 // pick clicked here. Plays run one at a time on the one shared store.
5 < 2 // arrive over /ws and redraw in place.
